# A FIXTURE written by the core stream (L263) to the tags GSAS-II's importer reads from an ISODISTORT mode CIF.
# It is NOT an output of ISODISTORT: none is in manuals/ and iso.byu.edu could not be reached. It tests the
# reader's mechanics (loops, IDs, label parts, norms, the matrix) only. SrTiO3's octahedral tilt, Pm-3m -> I4/mcm.
data_isodistort-output

_cell_length_a      5.51543
_cell_length_b      5.51543
_cell_length_c      7.80000
_cell_angle_alpha   90.0
_cell_angle_beta    90.0
_cell_angle_gamma   90.0
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M "I 4/m c m"

